{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At 'Only Pinball' you can expect pinball tables in the style of the 80s, 90s and modern.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You get realistic physics, elaborately modeled tables, atmospheric lighting, high-quality sounds and exciting themes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or with up to 4 friends and chase the high score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust the strength of your pinball fingers and choose one of the 3 settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, you can also play with 5 balls if 3 balls aren't enough for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only Pinball is a pinball collection that is continually being expanded. Exciting new topics as well as improved classics from \u201cMalzbie\u2019s Pinball Collection\u201d will be found here.<br><br>At the moment, 5 pinball tables have been completed and are fully playable. </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Fire-Snake Jackpot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2821740/dde570d78659a66ee1c98215ac083af9ec49d148.jpg"},{"name":"All Missions!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2821740/3683da49920ddc3d652444d0b90d9bedd2e80580.jpg"},{"name":"5,000,000 Points","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2821740/95a704c60518ac91e8427cc657dab8805acdc517.jpg"},{"name":"Big Bonus","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2821740/3760d67d9c9f190b03b6d176bd9db98d45ee0691.jpg"},{"name":"Especially For You","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2821740/87b98f9f1e19b3307e3269f2013a792d3e82ebca.jpg"},{"name":"You Are The Number One!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2821740/34386e3f249f8f3619797d17343e206358080f88.jpg"},{"name":"Extra Extra Extra Extraball","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/st